  "readme": "# Hunyuan 3D 3.1 Part Splitter\nHunyuan 3D 3.1 Part by Tencent splits an FBX 3D model into its separate parts and returns one FBX file per part.\n## Highlights\n- Provides an image-to-3D part-generation pipeline.\n- Uses P3-SAM for part detection and segmentation.\n- Produces semantic features, part segments, and part bounding boxes.\n- Uses X-Part to complete the detected components.\n- Operates its part-analysis workflow on an input mesh.\n## Fields\n| Field | Type | Default | Notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `model_url` | string, required | — | URL of the FBX model to split. FBX only, max 100MB, up to 30,000 faces. AI-generated models work best. |\n## Output\n- `url`: Main 3D file (GLB unless another export format is selected).\n## Billing\n$0.45 per request.\nFailed runs are not charged.\n## Also on SandBase\nOther Tencent 3D endpoints: `tencent/hunyuan-3d/3.0/image-to-3d`, `tencent/hunyuan-3d/3.1/pro/image-to-3d`, `tencent/hunyuan-3d/3.1/pro/text-to-3d`, `tencent/hunyuan-3d/3.1/rapid/image-to-3d`.\n",
